#: ../doc/export.rst:158
msgid "Export Complete"
msgstr "Ekspor Selesai"

#: ../doc/export.rst:160
msgid ""
"When an export finishes, a :guilabel:`Complete` tab opens in the Export "
"window (unless :guilabel:`Show Export Dialog when Finished` is turned off in"
" :ref:`preferences_ref`). It shows where the file was saved, with a button "
"to copy its path, along with a summary of the export: format, resolution, "
"quality, file size, duration, and how long the export took."
msgstr ""
"Saat ekspor selesai, tab :guilabel:`Complete` akan terbuka di jendela Ekspor"
" (kecuali :guilabel:`Show Export Dialog when Finished` dimatikan di "
":ref:`preferences_ref`). Tab ini menunjukkan lokasi file disimpan, dengan "
"tombol untuk menyalin jalurnya, beserta ringkasan ekspor: format, resolusi, "
"kualitas, ukuran file, durasi, dan berapa lama ekspor berlangsung."

#: ../doc/export.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Watch Video` opens the exported file in your default video player"
" (:guilabel:`Play Audio` for audio-only exports)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Watch Video` membuka file yang diekspor di pemutar video default "
"Anda (:guilabel:`Play Audio` untuk ekspor hanya audio)."

#: ../doc/export.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open Containing Folder` opens your file manager with the exported"
" file selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Open Containing Folder` membuka pengelola file Anda dengan file "
"yang diekspor terpilih."

#: ../doc/export.rst:169
msgid ""
"The `Simple` and `Advanced` tabs are still available, but read-only, so you "
"can review exactly which settings were used. Click :guilabel:`Done` to close"
" the window."
msgstr ""
"Tab `Simple` dan `Advanced` masih tersedia, tetapi hanya baca, sehingga Anda"
" dapat meninjau pengaturan yang digunakan. Klik :guilabel:`Done` untuk "
"menutup jendela."

#: ../doc/export.rst:172
msgid ""
"If an export fails, an :guilabel:`Export Failed` tab explains what went "
"wrong. :guilabel:`Copy Error Details` copies the error and export settings "
"(helpful when reporting a problem), and :guilabel:`Try Again` reopens the "
"Export window with the same settings."
msgstr ""
"Jika ekspor gagal, tab :guilabel:`Export Failed` menjelaskan apa yang salah."
" :guilabel:`Copy Error Details` menyalin kesalahan dan pengaturan ekspor "
"(berguna saat melaporkan masalah), dan :guilabel:`Try Again` membuka kembali"
" jendela Ekspor dengan pengaturan yang sama."

#: ../doc/export.rst:176
msgid ""
"A successful export also fires a burst of confetti. Use the "
":guilabel:`Celebrate Exports` preference to show it on the first export only"
" (the default), on every export, or never."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor yang berhasil juga menampilkan ledakan konfeti. Gunakan preferensi "
":guilabel:`Celebrate Exports` untuk menampilkannya hanya pada ekspor pertama"
" (default), pada setiap ekspor, atau tidak pernah."

#: ../doc/export.rst:182
msgid "Social Media Quick Reference"
msgstr "Referensi Cepat Media Sosial"

#: ../doc/export.rst:184
msgid ""
"The table below shows the recommended :guilabel:`Target` and "
":guilabel:`Video Profile` settings for common social media platforms. Select"
" these in the **Simple** tab of the Export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Tabel di bawah ini menunjukkan pengaturan :guilabel:`Target` dan "
":guilabel:`Video Profile` yang direkomendasikan untuk platform media sosial "
"umum. Pilih ini di tab **Simple** pada dialog Ekspor."

